<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: strike command center -->
  <DMSE_StrikeCommandCenter.label>打擊指揮中心</DMSE_StrikeCommandCenter.label>
  <!-- EN: An automated fire-direction center for coordinated missile strikes. Pick a world target, assign the strike missiles loaded on this map's launchers to waves, and fire them wave by wave so cheap missiles can draw enemy interceptors away from the valuable ones. Each wave is limited by the free guidance channels of this map's fire-control radars; every launched missile holds a channel for a short guidance period. Confirming a plan reserves its missiles and starts a short automatic firing-solution computation. -->
  <DMSE_StrikeCommandCenter.description>協調導彈打擊的自動化火力指揮中心。選定世界目標後，把本地圖發射架上的進攻導彈分配到各波次並逐波發射，讓便宜的導彈先引走敵方攔截彈，保護後面的高價值導彈。每波上限為本地圖火控雷達的空閒導引通道數；每枚升空的導彈會占用一條通道一小段導引期。確認計畫後相關導彈會被保留，並開始一段短暫的自動彈道計算。</DMSE_StrikeCommandCenter.description>
  
  <!-- EN: strike planning table -->
  <DMSE_StrikePlanningTable.label>打擊規劃桌</DMSE_StrikePlanningTable.label>
  <!-- EN: A plotting table with ballistic tables and slide rules for planning coordinated missile strikes by hand. It plans waves like the strike command center, but once a plan is confirmed a colonist must compute the firing solutions here as research work. Solutions are worked out missile by missile in wave order, so the first wave can be fired while later waves are still being computed. Needs no power, but each wave is still limited by the free guidance channels of this map's fire-control radars. -->
  <DMSE_StrikePlanningTable.description>以標圖桌、彈道表與計算尺人工規劃協同導彈打擊。波次規劃方式與打擊指揮中心相同，但確認計畫後必須由殖民者在此以研究工作完成彈道計算。彈道依波次順序逐枚解出，後面的波次還在計算時就能先發射第 1 波。不需電力，但每波仍受本地圖火控雷達的空閒導引通道限制。</DMSE_StrikePlanningTable.description>
  
</LanguageData>